28921970391006,"w":0.61111110687255854,"x":0.11316873658429656,"y":0.32122093049168288,"text":"Talk together about the different jobs and say which would be the most interesting."},{"y":0.66133720943996699,"h":0.0087209299193581336,"w":0.047325100898742672,"x":0.10699588566173979,"text":"PART 2"},{"w":0.20781892776489258,"y":0.67872903790144989,"text":"Talk about work experience.","x":0.10699588731782804,"h":0.01167793896802205},{"y":0.69329214465841649,"h":0.011649715931985827,"w":0.29629629135131835,"text":"• Would you like to do work experience?","x":0.10493827188263992},{"text":"What job would you like to try?","w":0.22222221374511719,"h":0.01162790683971926,"y":0.70639534890572175,"x":0.12551440382703},{"w":0.31275718688964843,"text":"• How do you thinkyou would feel on your","x":0.10493828289262425,"y":0.72093023255397759,"h":0.0116381699914756},{"h":0.013239187996469615,"x":0.12757202272783444,"w":0.20370368957519533,"text":"first day of work experience?","y":0.73389232146958205},{"w":0.31275718688964849,"x":0.55144034180894774,"h":0.011677938547159594,"text":"• What do you think you should wear when","y":0.67872903812851404},{"text":"you do work experience?","x":0.57407408078575595,"h":0.011649715511123371,"w":0.17901233673095707,"y":0.69329214477646883},{"y":0.7063953489085919,"w":0.38683128356933594,"h":0.013081394879037256,"x":0.55144032992315095,"text":"• What skills can you learn by doing work experience?"},{"w":0.34773662567138675,"h":0.013273824976275495,"text":"• How is work experience useful when you apply","x":0.55144033317768104,"y":0.72238372132865003},{"h":0.011666393027511823,"text":"for a job or university?","w":0.15843621253967288,"x":0.57201645899079467,"y":0.73546511639603196},{"x":0.082251422339378377,"w":0.81902618408203143,"y":0.76306346480226239,"text":"3 Discuss this question together. 'It's better to be self-employed than work for a company.' What do you think?","h":0.015405131354336188},{"x":0.12962963186600301,"h":0.011915269196822509,"text":"For self-employed work:","w":0.17901233673095701,"y":0.79346866724247478},{"y":0.79346866720900755,"w":0.20987653732299805,"x":0.55144033154426242,"h":0.013239187996469615,"text":"Against self-employed work:"},{"text":"Self-employed people ...","w":0.18518518447875978,"y":0.81685789918642115,"x":0.12962963229765709,"h":0.01163047283808949},{"x":0.12962962287981963,"y":0.83430232565277795,"w":0.34362140655517581,"text":"• are free to do what they want to in their careers.","h":0.013081394879037256},{"text":"• can decide on their own working hours.","w":0.30246912002563475,"x":0.12962964129891091,"y":0.85029069770659382,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"x":0.1275720163140904,"h":0.010284744946175928,"text":"• can work where they want to.","y":0.86482558174256119,"w":0.23251028060913084},{"x":0.12757202822832844,"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"• choose who they want to work with.","y":0.87775816405826868,"w":0.27983537673950198},{"x":0.5514403318861345,"text":"Self-employed people ...","y":0.81818181828250591,"w":0.18518518447875976,"h":0.01191526919682262},{"y":0.83575581402200083,"x":0.54938273280411887,"h":0.011627906839719149,"text":"• don't earn money when they're sick or on holiday.","w":0.36008228302001954},{"w":0.36008228302001954,"h":0.011627906839719149,"text":"• don't get benefits, such as a pension or insurance.","x":0.54938273130377613,"y":0.85029069770659382},{"x":0.54938271558770058,"y":0.86319505744952107,"w":0.32098766326904293,"h":0.013258430669503385,"text":"• could be unemployed for periods of time."},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"x":0.54938272947274658,"y":0.87775816405826856,"w":0.35802467346191402,"text":"• sometimes get lonely if they work on their own."},{"x":0.91152263389945631,"h":0.013081394879037256,"y":0.95058139574725475,"text":"85","w":0.024691357612609877}]